			"notes": "# Version 1.1\n\n## Now requires [DillonLib](https://modrinth.com/mod/dillon-lib) in order to run.\n\n## Changes\n- New texture for enchantment transferrer block.\n- New interface for the enchantment transferrer.\n    - Transferring enchantments has been optimized.\n    - You can now transfer enchantments directly to empty books.\n    - Add a diamond to negate durability damage from the tool.\n    - Purely based off of the [Speedrunner Mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/speedrunner-mod).\n- The enchantment transferrer is now considered a \"block entity\".\n- Fixed bug where using enchantment transferrer sometimes opens the crafting table GUI.\n- Now requires Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or greater to load.\n- Backend optimizations."
		},
